    "g11": "Multiplication and exponential power series are already explicit; preserve the equations and sampling, replace listOf, and format actual Kotlin. No new helper should hide these operations.",
    "g12": "Retain OIDN native denoiser/resource ownership; link both class and install/request methods. Committed hardware-profile captures remain retained.",
    "g13": "Expose editable weighted hands, seed, lock point and improvisation; retain reusable seeded pattern algorithms and link them.",
    "g14": "Explicit editable pavilion geometry, camera and studio controls. Retain genuine Three viewer path-tracing/ownership API.",
